  "head_commit": {
    "id": "29502c6d9b97af1c7af2a46587d7d3265edfb1db",
    "tree_id": "ae58011b7e79b8e58bb01282025a3f718bb6d8c3",
    "message": "ci: Publish and sign a single component image (#4830)\n\nPublishing a change to one component currently builds, pushes and signs\nthe full image collection, slowing deployment iterations.\n\nAdd an optional image-name input to the manual maybe-push-images.yml\nworkflow and its reusable publishing and signing calls. This lets a\ndeveloper build, publish and sign just the component being changed.\nReusable callers can also pass the input when they need to select one\ncomponent.\n\nValidate that the selected image has a signing target before publishing\nit. Omitting image-name retains full publication, as used by the\nstandard Update CMMS workflow.\n\nRELNOTES: Set image-name in maybe-push-images.yml to publish and sign a\nsingle supported image.\nIssue: #4894",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-13T23:02:44Z",
    "author": {
      "name": "Steven Ware Jones",
      "email": "stevenwarejones@gmail.com"
    },
    "committer": {
